  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDescribe the effect of combining the reflections in part \u003cb\u003eb\u003c/b\u003e and part \u003cb\u003ec\u003c/b\u003e. Can the original triangle be transformed to the final triangle with a single transformation?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe vertices of the original triangle are at (–2, 1), (–1, 1), and (–1, 3). The vertices of the final image triangle are at (2, 1), (1, –1), and (1, –3).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe vertices of the original triangle are at (–2, 1), (–1, 1), and (–1, 3). The vertices of the final image triangle are at (2, 1), (1, –1), and (1, –3). Both coordinates have been multiplied by –1.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_7_1_geometry_3d_60/f-60-3c-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThis could be achieved by a rotation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe combined transformation corresponds to a 180\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19075\" class\u003d\"text-top\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/degree.gif\"\u003e rotation about the origin. However, you can\u0027t do this on the TI–73. The rotation feature only allows rotation about one of the vertices of the figure.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e(Note: To exit the GEOBOARD application, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19076\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19077\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qquit.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19077\u0026quot;,207)\"\u003e, answer \"Yes\" at the prompt \"Quit this board?\", answer \"No\" at the prompt \"Save this board?\", then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19078\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19078\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19079\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19079\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19080\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19080\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19081\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e to quit.)\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
